  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【しまなみ海道】瀬戸内海を一望する絶景温泉宿！今治・来島海峡大橋の夕景と海鮮会席</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">青い海と島々を渡る風が心地よい「しまなみ海道」。夕暮れ時に茜色へ染まる瀬戸内海を展望露天風呂から眺め、獲れたての新鮮な魚介を味わう極上の島旅をご案内します。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-6 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/182375/182375.jpg\" alt=\"天然温泉　海道の湯　スーパーホテル今治\" class=\"w-full md:w-48 h-36 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold text-[10px] rounded-full\">特選おすすめ</span>\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-base leading-snug\">天然温泉　海道の湯　スーパーホテル今治</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">愛媛県今治市松本町4-6-10 ｜ 【平面無料駐車場１１１台完備】今治駅から徒歩約１９分 / 今治I.Cから車で約９分 / スーパーまで徒歩3分☆</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700 pt-1\">\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">⭐ 4.34（1055件の評価）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1名目安: ¥4,050〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-amber-50/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-amber-100\">男女別天然温泉・ウェルカムバー飲み放題（18～20時半）朝食ビュッフェ・敷地内平面駐車場が全て無料！</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-2\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D182375\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-stone-50/80 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 space-y-2.5\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/191656/191656.jpg\" alt=\"天然温泉「旅人の湯」ホテルルートイン今治\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm\">天然温泉「旅人の湯」ホテルルートイン今治</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">愛媛県今治市馬越町3-3-15</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.41</span>\n          <span>参考: ¥5,150〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D191656\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:underline\">\n        詳細・プランを見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-stone-50/80 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 space-y-2.5\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/191553/191553.jpg\" alt=\"しまなみプライムホテル今治\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm\">しまなみプライムホテル今治</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">愛媛県今治市常盤町4-6-10</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-70